   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div>it appears that the output order is based on the order of statements in the model.  Perhaps you could induce a certain order of output by referencing the variables in the same order as they appear in the input covariance matrix, even if they are just statements about their variances / residual variances being free parameters.</div><div>--Ed Rigdon<br><br></div></div>"
    ],
